983
00:48:29,260 --> 00:48:36,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos yung disbursement, ang baba-baba pati, nasa 1.45.973 million.

984
00:48:36,580 --> 00:48:51,040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So what justifies this humongous increase in the allocation from 2026 to 2027 na 5 billion lang dati, lumobo na sa 37.493.

985
00:48:51,360 --> 00:48:55,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Samantalang hindi naman pala nagagastos ang baba-baba ng implementation.

986
00:48:55,260 --> 00:48:58,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Di ba yan parati ninyo sinisita sa amin?

987
00:48:58,620 --> 00:48:59,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi nag-iimplement.

988
00:48:59,260 --> 00:49:03,200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi nag-iimplement itong mga ahensya at hindi pwede natin i-increase.

989
00:49:03,300 --> 00:49:06,760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Identify please the projects and explain.

990
00:49:06,940 --> 00:49:11,000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang baba ng implementation, ba't kayo nagdagdag ng napakalaki?

991
00:49:12,080 --> 00:49:15,260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: From 5 billion, naging 37.493.

992
00:49:16,140 --> 00:49:17,880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Paano himala yan?

993
00:49:18,800 --> 00:49:26,560
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, again we note that almost half of the amount appropriated for Falgo went to the rice distribution program.

994
00:49:26,560 --> 00:49:28,500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And we recognize the figures.

995
00:49:28,500 --> 00:49:32,320
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And we recognize the figures stated by the Honorable Marcos on the implementation.

996
00:49:32,660 --> 00:49:38,460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: These may be the figures from the monitoring of the DILG of the implementation of the Falgo.

997
00:49:38,960 --> 00:49:40,680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi palagas ninyo, DBM2.

998
00:49:41,560 --> 00:49:41,740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Oo.

999
00:49:42,520 --> 00:49:43,780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nasa 4.3 lang.

1000
00:49:43,780 --> 00:49:51,380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Because it was generated, Your Honor, from the actual LGU-reported obligation and disbursement under the Subay Bayan Portal.

1001
00:49:51,380 --> 00:49:52,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay. Ganito na lang, Secretary.

1002
00:49:53,180 --> 00:49:58,380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Identify the projects and LGUs provided assistance under the 2025 and 2027.

1003
00:49:58,500 --> 00:50:02,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: FAA Appropriation for Falgo.

1004
00:50:02,880 --> 00:50:03,520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung FAA.

1005
00:50:04,460 --> 00:50:13,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Bigay na lang ninyo listahan bago mag-plenary kami kung talagang handa ba sila mag-implement and the measures needed to prevent another backlog.

1006
00:50:14,080 --> 00:50:19,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 4.3, entering the last quarter is a miserable figure.

1007
00:50:20,360 --> 00:50:21,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: You know that better than I.

1008
00:50:21,760 --> 00:50:22,940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kayo nagmo-monitor dyan.

1009
00:50:23,420 --> 00:50:25,020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So yung next question ko.

1010
00:50:25,020 --> 00:50:27,080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With the indulgence of Senator Marcos.

1011
00:50:27,300 --> 00:50:27,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: With that.

1012
00:50:27,480 --> 00:50:29,300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para nang hindi naulitin mamaya.

1013
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:32,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nagiging magandang.

1014
00:50:32,340 --> 00:50:36,960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It will be nice if this can be addressed as Secretary de Leon.

1015
00:50:37,660 --> 00:50:38,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That itong.

1016
00:50:39,240 --> 00:50:41,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: They view the LGSF now as the port.

1017
00:50:41,960 --> 00:50:42,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The new port.

1018
00:50:43,320 --> 00:50:46,220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para mawala na lang po yung ganong agam-agam.

1019
00:50:46,300 --> 00:50:49,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's the DBM that nagpo-process.

1020
00:50:50,300 --> 00:50:51,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nag-revet supposedly.

1021
00:50:51,560 --> 00:50:56,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So can you just tell us what are the criteria, factors, parameters?

1022
00:50:57,040 --> 00:50:57,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: BAU.

1023
00:50:57,480 --> 00:51:05,460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: In determining which LGUs receive more support, ilang porsyento ng ating mga LGUs ang nakinabang sa LGSF allocation

1024
00:51:05,460 --> 00:51:11,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: para makita natin kung may pinapaboran ba o talagang lahat naman ay napagbibigyan.

1025
00:51:11,380 --> 00:51:19,560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So can you address this issue once and for all para malaman natin kung ano yung criteria, factors, and parameters.

1026
00:51:20,040 --> 00:51:21,460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

1027
00:51:21,520 --> 00:51:21,980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Your Honor.

1028
00:51:21,980 --> 00:51:27,180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We would gladly share the parameters we are using.

1029
00:51:27,480 --> 00:51:30,300
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: In terms of processing the release for LGUs.

1030
00:51:30,300 --> 00:51:40,460
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But to the Honorable Senator Marcos' request for the list, we will certainly provide the list of recipients of FALGO for 2025 and 2026.

1031
00:51:40,940 --> 00:51:45,420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But as of right now, the list is also available online through the DBM Compass.

1032
00:51:45,580 --> 00:51:50,000
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But we'll certainly furnish the list to the committee and to the Senator's office.

1033
00:51:50,420 --> 00:51:57,300
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: For the criteria that we use, the DBM looks at certain parameters in releasing the funds to our...

1034
00:51:57,480 --> 00:52:00,800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Number one, good financial housekeeping.

1035
00:52:01,480 --> 00:52:04,480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Second is compliance with the reporting requirements.

1036
00:52:05,160 --> 00:52:14,680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: As we have said, we are working with the DILG to make sure that the LGUs are using the funds in accordance with the purpose for which it was released.

1037
00:52:15,100 --> 00:52:25,920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is why we also have the Subay Bayan portal that is up and live right now where our fellow citizens can actually see the status of the projects funded by the FALGO.

1038
00:52:25,920 --> 00:52:26,920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We also look at...

1039
00:52:27,480 --> 00:52:36,980
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Prior accomplishment, both physical and financial, in terms of their utilization of the past LGSF FALGO releases.

1040
00:52:37,800 --> 00:52:51,280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: As to the question on reference on the LGSF as pork, may we note that in the Belgica versus Ochoa case, which declared the pork barrel system unconstitutional,

1041
00:52:51,280 --> 00:52:53,280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: there's a decision that actually...

1042
00:52:54,320 --> 00:52:57,280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Decision by the Supreme Court in Belgica versus Executive Secretariat.

1043
00:52:57,480 --> 00:53:12,940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That actually upheld the constitutionality of the LGSF under the 2014 GAA, recognizing its discernible singular appropriation purpose of providing funds for supporting local governments.

1044
00:53:13,400 --> 00:53:20,820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: The court further ruled that the LGSF satisfied the two requirements, which is completeness and sufficiency standard test.

1045
00:53:20,820 --> 00:53:26,540
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But as we have mentioned at the House of Representatives, we remain committed to working with Congress.

1046
00:53:26,540 --> 00:53:36,920
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: If there is a need to introduce additional measures and safeguards to make sure that the local government support fund complies with this jurisprudence of the Supreme Court, Mr. Chair or Honor.

1047
00:53:37,320 --> 00:53:38,540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Secretary De Leon.

1048
00:53:38,640 --> 00:53:42,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Before Senator Marcos, I'd just like to acknowledge the presence of Senator Pangilinan.

1049
00:53:43,380 --> 00:53:45,620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you. Please proceed, Senator Marcos.

1050
00:53:45,620 --> 00:53:53,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Having said that, at lahat naman tayo kilala yung Belgica versus Ochoa,

1051
00:53:53,540 --> 00:53:55,500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang tinatanong ko lang,

1052
00:53:55,500 --> 00:53:58,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: bakit napaka-baba ng implementasyon?

1053
00:53:58,340 --> 00:53:59,860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang baba-baba ng implementation.

1054
00:54:00,560 --> 00:54:01,720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What is it actually now?

1055
00:54:01,800 --> 00:54:03,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sinasabi mo, half went to the rise.

1056
00:54:04,040 --> 00:54:07,300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero actually, ang nasa libro ninyo, nasa 4.3 lang,

1057
00:54:07,800 --> 00:54:10,500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ang na-obligate.

1058
00:54:10,800 --> 00:54:13,420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos mas mababa pa dun yung nadidisperse.

1059
00:54:13,840 --> 00:54:15,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So ano ba talaga yung totoo?

1060
00:54:15,180 --> 00:54:16,940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ba't ang baba-baba higit sa lahat?

1061
00:54:17,040 --> 00:54:20,620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At bakit tayo nagdadagdag kung hindi naman natin na-implement?

1062
00:54:20,760 --> 00:54:22,680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kayo ang makulit dyan eh, kung tutuusin.

1063
00:54:25,500 --> 00:54:30,880
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And we look at really the bottom line why the implementation of the LGSF

1064
00:54:30,880 --> 00:54:33,740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: went a little bit slow for this time.

1065
00:54:34,260 --> 00:54:37,500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Half of the funds went to rise and in fact…

1066
00:54:37,500 --> 00:54:39,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maling rise kasi napakaraming rise.

1067
00:54:39,160 --> 00:54:40,940
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: It's the rise distribution program.

1068
00:54:40,940 --> 00:54:47,020
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Ito po yung rise distribution program under the LGSF.

1069
00:54:47,120 --> 00:54:50,280
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Ito po yung under the banner of Bawat Bayan Makikinabang.

1070
00:54:50,380 --> 00:54:53,520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ito po yung program rin ng LGSF.

1071
00:54:54,380 --> 00:54:55,280
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Maliban pa sa…

1072
00:54:55,500 --> 00:54:57,140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Billion-billion sa DA.

1073
00:54:57,700 --> 00:54:58,760
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That is correct, Your Honor.

1074
00:54:58,900 --> 00:55:00,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos may rise program din.

1075
00:55:02,220 --> 00:55:05,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ito ba yung rise for all program or iba pa to?

1076
00:55:05,480 --> 00:55:09,140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Ang rise for all program, Your Honor, ito po yung under ng DA.

1077
00:55:09,140 --> 00:55:13,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And ito naman, yung LGSF price, magkano yan?

1078
00:55:16,120 --> 00:55:17,760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Grabing kadami naman ng rise.

1079
00:55:17,980 --> 00:55:22,880
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: I'm just getting the actual amount, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

1080
00:55:23,020 --> 00:55:25,420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: But the rise program under the LGSF,

1081
00:55:25,500 --> 00:55:29,180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: ito po yung ang intention niya is to provide free rise allocation

1082
00:55:29,180 --> 00:55:32,840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: para sa bottom 25% of the population.

1083
00:55:33,360 --> 00:55:37,140
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: As of October 15, from that LGSF amount,

1084
00:55:37,660 --> 00:55:41,820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: 22.96 billion have been released to various LGUs

1085
00:55:41,820 --> 00:55:44,620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: for the implementation of the rise distribution program.

1086
00:55:44,660 --> 00:55:48,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, ito sa DA, hiwalay pa rin sa DSWD.

1087
00:55:48,720 --> 00:55:51,760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: This is directly released to the LGUs, Your Honor.

1088
00:55:51,760 --> 00:55:53,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For the record lang, Secretary,

1089
00:55:53,780 --> 00:55:59,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: magkano na ako na-disperse natin for the rise distribution program under the LGSF?

1090
00:56:00,820 --> 00:56:01,420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Tama.

1091
00:56:04,820 --> 00:56:05,620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That's correct.

1092
00:56:05,840 --> 00:56:07,800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Insofar as the national government, Your Honor,

1093
00:56:08,000 --> 00:56:12,420
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: we book recording when the funds are transferred to the LGUs.

1094
00:56:12,540 --> 00:56:15,600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, it's the 22 billion that's already released to the LGUs.

1095
00:56:15,640 --> 00:56:19,320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Almost 23 is actually in the LGU na.

1096
00:56:19,980 --> 00:56:21,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala na yan sa inyo talaga.

1097
00:56:21,500 --> 00:56:22,820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That is correct, Your Honor.

1098
00:56:22,820 --> 00:56:23,620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: It's downloaded.

1099
00:56:23,780 --> 00:56:25,180
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: It's not obligated or disbursed.

1100
00:56:25,320 --> 00:56:25,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano na siya?

1101
00:56:26,340 --> 00:56:28,740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: On the books of the national government, Your Honor,

1102
00:56:28,820 --> 00:56:31,500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: it's both obligated and disbursed to the local government.

1103
00:56:31,780 --> 00:56:33,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: O, sige. So, wala na kayo sa 4.3?

1104
00:56:35,620 --> 00:56:41,400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Probably, Your Honor, the 4.3 is the aggregate implementation of the LGUs themselves.

1105
00:56:41,580 --> 00:56:42,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi ko alam.

1106
00:56:42,360 --> 00:56:44,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: After nanggaring rin sa inyo yung figure na yan,

1107
00:56:45,020 --> 00:56:46,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: kaya ako nagtataka eh.

1108
00:56:46,460 --> 00:56:48,600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos dadagdagan ng limpak-limpak.

1109
00:56:48,940 --> 00:56:50,020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakakasindak naman talaga.

1110
00:56:50,200 --> 00:56:53,020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: In any case, I'd like to proceed to another...

1111
00:56:53,780 --> 00:56:56,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which already has been raised by our chairman.

1112
00:56:57,220 --> 00:57:02,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ito yung nakakabiglang desisyon ng Supreme Court

1113
00:57:02,800 --> 00:57:08,360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: determining the unconstitutionality of both the GAA 2024 and 2025.

1114
00:57:09,320 --> 00:57:13,560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The doctrine, obviously, of operative fact is in play.

1115
00:57:14,120 --> 00:57:16,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And Justice Leono, who penned the decision,

1116
00:57:17,040 --> 00:57:19,360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: invoked that together with good faith

1117
00:57:19,360 --> 00:57:23,660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and asserting no blanket shield for officials.

1118
00:57:23,780 --> 00:57:26,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Who condoned such releases.

1119
00:57:26,720 --> 00:57:31,080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the accountability is reasserted over these funds.

1120
00:57:31,080 --> 00:57:36,940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, criminal, administrative, and civil cases can follow this decision.

1121
00:57:37,340 --> 00:57:39,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I understand it will be appealed by the executive.

1122
00:57:39,820 --> 00:57:42,520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nevertheless, what is very, very clear is that

1123
00:57:42,520 --> 00:57:47,700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: unexpended amounts from the budget of 2024 to 2025,

1124
00:57:48,720 --> 00:57:53,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: unexpended or unspent amounts can no longer be disbursed.

1125
00:57:53,780 --> 00:57:55,820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano ang pagkaintindi ninyo yan?

1126
00:57:55,920 --> 00:57:56,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: What is the scope?

1127
00:57:57,620 --> 00:58:03,680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Because the dispositive portion identifies specific congressional increases.

1128
00:58:04,280 --> 00:58:05,300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakita natin yan.

1129
00:58:05,800 --> 00:58:11,340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And declares unconstitutional, consequently, the entire budget.

1130
00:58:12,040 --> 00:58:13,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Anong intindi ninyo yan?

1131
00:58:13,940 --> 00:58:19,680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Does the DBM interpret this as the entire GAA of both years

1132
00:58:19,680 --> 00:58:21,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: becoming unconstitutional?

1133
00:58:21,580 --> 00:58:23,580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The unprogrammed appropriations?

1134
00:58:23,780 --> 00:58:29,920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Or only those congressional increases that were identified in the decision?

1135
00:58:31,100 --> 00:58:36,160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are you interpreting narrowly, or moderately, or liberally?

1136
00:58:36,460 --> 00:58:37,220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Samba tayo.

1137
00:58:37,860 --> 00:58:41,520
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, actually over the past two nights,

1138
00:58:42,040 --> 00:58:47,040
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: the DBM-EXECOM has been carefully reviewing the Supreme Court's decision

1139
00:58:47,040 --> 00:58:52,760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: to assess not only its legal, but also the fiscal, technical, and operational implications.

1140
00:58:52,760 --> 00:58:53,760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: And to determine whether or not the DBM-EXECOM is going to be unconstitutional,

1141
00:58:53,760 --> 00:58:56,800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: and to determine the appropriate steps and next steps.

1142
00:58:56,900 --> 00:58:59,080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: As mentioned by the Honorable Marcos,

1143
00:58:59,440 --> 00:59:02,340
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: in fact, that's one of our points for discussion.

1144
00:59:02,800 --> 00:59:09,760
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: With the reference to the declaration of unconstitutionality

1145
00:59:09,760 --> 00:59:12,800
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: as a consequence of the entire 2025 GAA,

1146
00:59:13,260 --> 00:59:16,840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: which remains valid up to now because it's continuing appropriation.

1147
00:59:17,000 --> 00:59:17,080
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Tama.

1148
00:59:17,360 --> 00:59:18,160
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We are still...

1149
00:59:18,160 --> 00:59:18,820
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Malawan toon yan eh, dito.

1150
00:59:18,820 --> 00:59:19,500
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That's correct, Your Honor.

1151
00:59:19,620 --> 00:59:21,540
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: So, pasok pa rin ng 2026.

1152
00:59:21,540 --> 00:59:23,540
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We are discussing and probably discussing,

1153
00:59:23,760 --> 00:59:27,620
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: this is one of the items as mentioned by the Office of the Solicitor General

1154
00:59:27,620 --> 00:59:31,400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: that we will be seeking clarification from the Supreme Court

